      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Early preview, more screenshots and details coming soon!)</strong><i><br><br>Scientists have discovered a groundbreaking technology, the ability to open Rifts, tears in space that allow instant travel across short distances. A massive leap for mankind... but before risking it on humans, they needed a test subject.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naturally, they chose snakes. The reasoning remains classified.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reimagine Snake with Portals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new ways to experience Snake by strategically moving around using portals, rush to golden fruits, travel through shortcuts, and get out of complicated situations. Just be careful! you might get too tangled up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.poster.avif?t=1778896311\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.webm?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.mp4?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New mechanics that put you to the Test!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new mechanics that will push your newfound portal abilities to the test! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.poster.avif?t=1778896311\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.webm?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.mp4?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own challenges with the Level Editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your creativity into making your own custom levels to test and experiment all the layouts that come to mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock different looks and modifiers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Snake to your own taste! change its skin or mix and match modifiers to experience each level in a whole different way! Just be careful what you combine, you might accidentally make your Snake impossible to survive!</p>",
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Early preview, more screenshots and details coming soon!)</strong><i><br><br>Scientists have discovered a groundbreaking technology, the ability to open Rifts, tears in space that allow instant travel across short distances. A massive leap for mankind... but before risking it on humans, they needed a test subject.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naturally, they chose snakes. The reasoning remains classified.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reimagine Snake with Portals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new ways to experience Snake by strategically moving around using portals, rush to golden fruits, travel through shortcuts, and get out of complicated situations. Just be careful! you might get too tangled up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.poster.avif?t=1778896311\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.webm?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/9ceeca00f691cb70577c00d1553af008.mp4?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New mechanics that put you to the Test!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new mechanics that will push your newfound portal abilities to the test! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.poster.avif?t=1778896311\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.webm?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724200/extras/663f18f9218cb856a4047ce4ee6f54cd.mp4?t=1778896311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own challenges with the Level Editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your creativity into making your own custom levels to test and experiment all the layouts that come to mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock different looks and modifiers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Snake to your own taste! change its skin or mix and match modifiers to experience each level in a whole different way! Just be careful what you combine, you might accidentally make your Snake impossible to survive!</p>",
      "short_description": "Snake. Portals. Chaos. Use portals to outsmart levels, dodge deadly obstacles and master every run, just don't get tangled up.",
      "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil",
