      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vector Storm</strong> is a fast-paced top-down arcade shooter that rewards aggression, precision, and smart builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fight through endless waves of escalating enemies, survive devastating boss encounters, and grow stronger with every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Survive. Build. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each run drops you into an arena that gets deadlier by the wave. Clear enemies to earn credits, spend them in the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  mid-run shop on weapons and upgrades, and scavenge gear from fallen bosses. Die, bank your tokens, and come back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Build Your Loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Equip tiered gear across seven slots — cockpit, wings, boosters, plating, shield, dampener, and weapon bay. Every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  piece changes how your ship performs. Stack synergies, push your combo multiplier, and find the build that carries you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   deepest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Five Ships. Five Playstyles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Start with the balanced Viper or unlock faster, stranger ships as you clear waves. The heavy Bastion regenerates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  shields. The Phantom opens with a stealth window. The Ironclad reflects damage back. Each ship demands a different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Tokens earned each run fund permanent upgrades — more health, faster fire rate, bonus starting credits, and more. Sink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   enough tokens into the tree and the arena changes with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Endless wave-based survival with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Seven-slot gear system with tiered boss drops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Five unlockable ships with unique passives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Deep mid-run upgrade shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Persistent meta-progression across runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Multiple distinct boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] 44 Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Global leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [*] Procedurally generated adaptive soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vector Storm</strong> is a fast-paced top-down arcade shooter that rewards aggression, precision, and smart builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fight through endless waves of escalating enemies, survive devastating boss encounters, and grow stronger with every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Survive. Build. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each run drops you into an arena that gets deadlier by the wave. Clear enemies to earn credits, spend them in the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  mid-run shop on weapons and upgrades, and scavenge gear from fallen bosses. Die, bank your tokens, and come back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Build Your Loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Equip tiered gear across seven slots — cockpit, wings, boosters, plating, shield, dampener, and weapon bay. Every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  piece changes how your ship performs. Stack synergies, push your combo multiplier, and find the build that carries you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   deepest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Five Ships. Five Playstyles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Start with the balanced Viper or unlock faster, stranger ships as you clear waves. The heavy Bastion regenerates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  shields. The Phantom opens with a stealth window. The Ironclad reflects damage back. Each ship demands a different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Tokens earned each run fund permanent upgrades — more health, faster fire rate, bonus starting credits, and more. Sink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   enough tokens into the tree and the arena changes with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Endless wave-based survival with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Seven-slot gear system with tiered boss drops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Five unlockable ships with unique passives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Deep mid-run upgrade shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Persistent meta-progression across runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Multiple distinct boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] 44 Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [] Global leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  [*] Procedurally generated adaptive soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
      "short_description": "A relentless top-down arcade shooter with roguelite progression. Blast through escalating waves, battle massive bosses, and build your loadout with boss-dropped gear. Earn tokens to permanently upgrade your fleet and unlock new ships between runs.",
